{
  "id": "ss.relic.halluc",
  "name": "Crossed scent",
  "description": "Three scent trails knotted through one another, each a colour the others never share a screen with, each ending in a head going somewhere else. The trails are what this relic ruins, so they are what it draws — and three saturated hues tangled in one 32px frame is the same sentence the relic writes on the field, where every body starts wearing a colour that is not its own. Everything about the three is deliberately unequal: struck at even spacing with one radius and one span they came out rotationally symmetric and read as a badge, a recycling mark rather than a tangle. No two here share a radius, a span, a centre distance or a head size.",
